{
  "case_id": "DEBT-STORMX2-1.21.1",
  "title": "「雷暴将至」×2 夜间加刷只对自然刷怪生效：午夜 + 持有 storm_approaching 时出现 storm_night_spawn_x2 机器行",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "channel": "kubejs",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "storm_approaching"
  },
  "on_fail": "continue",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "判据：`EventEffects#onFinalizeSpawn` 在 `MobSpawnType.NATURAL` + 夜间 + 64 格内有玩家持 storm_approaching 时复制一只，并落 `AP_EVENT_EFFECT: storm_night_spawn_x2:type=<id>`。\n本用例给足自然刷怪窗口（清场 → 午夜 → 最多 20 s），只断言机器行出现；计数类反例在 DEBT-STORM 的 S4（/summon 不复制）里。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set midnight",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/difficulty normal",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..48]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe debtstorm X1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 90000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe debtwave X2 32",
      "no_esc": true
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_X1_STORM:event=storm_approaching:ok=1:now=\\d+:err=none"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_EVENT_EFFECT: storm_night_spawn_x2:type=minecraft:"
    }
  ]
}